", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rLt6P-bCDHQQ7kNvwGoOssC&_nc_oc=AdoVc7KNFFLVbgKdNnFrE1-f_RHJ2KUktLIN_05dL6g9nKMiR5zcamFGI1yfaE3pmTY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx4IuYbqJo-mRWc4n4A5SY2cNjeNcOXXlCfVM7vJA10UQ&oe=69D11479"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P9tYauqRcdwQ7kNvwHymuEn&_nc_oc=Adp0LrrCboEYlNkC-eJge3QoCub_rBqje11Mt6GGpGBQzkhqBnU3yh4XP_hmhwlsYJ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx06KeEMB3aRV_wcN_6TStoNndD3HUcQfoccLTcEGxVJg&oe=69D0F30B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9vJhD-gQeDYQ7kNvwGTlFf_&_nc_oc=AdoSx8FGHDK4MaghZDyH3ghYP9BoK0a8aktIDeqaK0sfpjgov7IRKqQ_Oey6m50Z9F4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwywx74EIgwroYm4npKsuJQ9yAJ2v1FQh6nQeFoiUdEEA&oe=69D0F18E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel